# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
#                                  Chat evals                                  #
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- #

# Output of `tests/evals/run_chunk_tools_eval.py` — regenerated on every
# run, never source-of-truth. Historical snapshots (results-stage1-*) were
# accidentally committed during the Stage 1 development and removed in the
# cleanup pass; this rule keeps them out for good.
modules/services/chat/app/tests/evals/results.jsonl
modules/services/chat/app/tests/evals/results.filtered.jsonl
modules/services/chat/app/tests/evals/results.filtered.tmp.jsonl
modules/services/chat/app/tests/evals/results-stage*.jsonl